    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nA centrally located three-bedroom mid-terraced townhouse offering excellent potential for refurbishment and modernisation.\n\nSituated in a highly convenient town-centre location, 82 Irishtown presents an exciting opportunity for those seeking a property with scope to create a stylish and comfortable home in the heart of Clonmel. While the property is in need of repair and modernisation, its well-proportioned accommodation, rear garden and excellent location provide a strong foundation for a comprehensive refurbishment project.\n\nThe accommodation extends to approximately three bedrooms and is arranged over two floors. At ground floor level, the property comprises an entrance hallway, living room, bedroom, kitchen and guest WC. The first floor provides a landing, two further bedrooms and a bathroom.\n\nTo the rear is a private garden together with a useful storage shed, providing valuable outdoor space and additional storage.\n\nThe property is ideally positioned within easy walking distance of Clonmel town centre and all the amenities the town has to offer. Its central location also provides convenient access to public transport and the wider road network.\n\nOf particular interest to prospective purchasers is the property's potential eligibility for the Vacant Property Refurbishment Grant, subject to the relevant criteria and confirmation by the appropriate authority. This may provide an attractive opportunity for buyers seeking to undertake a substantial refurbishment and transform the property into a modern town-centre residence.\n\n82 Irishtown represents an excellent opportunity to acquire a centrally located project property in a prime town-centre setting."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nGROUND FLOOR - \n\n\nHallway - 1.59m x 5.78m\n\n\nLiving Room - 3.81m x 2.84m\n\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.81m x 2.82m\n\n\nKitchen - 2.10m x 3.45m\n\n\nW.C. - 0.76m x 1.45\n\n\nFIRST FLOOR - \n\n\nLanding - 3.73m x 2.91m\n\n\nBedroom 2 - 2.75m x 2.89m\n\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.68m x 2.91m\n\n\nBathroom - 3.92m x 2.83m\n\n\n"
      },
      {
