        "Content": "<ul><li>Highly convenient town-centre location</li><li>In need of repair and modernisation</li><li>Excellent refurbishment potential</li><li>Rear garden</li><li>Storage shed to rear</li><li>Potential eligibility for Vacant Property Refurbishment Grant (Subject to qualifying criteria).</li><li>Within easy walking distance of Clonmel town centre and local amenities</ul>"
